+++ b/docs/architecture/local-icons.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Local icon extension
+
+Enable `HERDR_AUTO_TITLE_ICONS=true` to prefix Auto Title's own decision with
+an agent or foreground-program icon. The position decorator runs last,
+so the output is `[position] icon title`, with one space after the number and two after the icon. Both decorators honor the title width
+limit and use the same context pane as the title resolver.
+
+`HERDR_AUTO_TITLE_AGENT_NAME=false` removes repeated agent text.
+Unknown agents use a robot icon; unknown programs use a terminal.
+
+Run only Auto Title as the naming writer. A separate icon watcher would be
+mistaken for a manual rename and prevent future title updates.
+
+This checkout is a local branch; merging upstream changes requires rebuilding.
+
+`HERDR_AUTO_TITLE_TITLE_SUFFIX` optionally removes an exact trailing string
+from agent activity before width fitting. Its default is empty.
